<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="wrap about-expanded">
    <div class="head center">
      <div class="kicker">ABOUT US</div>
      <h2>Tshwane SPCA – Protecting Animals Since 1910</h2>
      <p class="lead about-subtitle">
        Over 116 Years of Compassion, Protection and Hope
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>
        For more than a century, the Tshwane SPCA has been a voice for the
        voiceless, a protector of the vulnerable and a source of hope for
        animals in need.
      </p>
      <p>
        Established in 1910, we are one of South Africa's longest-standing
        animal welfare organisations, with a proud history of serving the
        greater Tshwane community.
      </p>
      <p>
        Through our <strong>Waltloo and Centurion branches</strong>, we remain
        dedicated to protecting animals from cruelty, neglect, abuse and
        abandonment, while promoting kindness, compassion and responsible animal
        ownership.
      </p>
      <h3>Every Animal Matters. Every Life Has Value.</h3>
      <p>
        At the Tshwane SPCA, we believe that every animal deserves to be treated
        with dignity, kindness and respect.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether rescuing an animal from cruelty, caring for an abandoned puppy,
        providing medical attention to an injured animal or helping a homeless
        pet find a loving family, our commitment remains the same:
        <strong>to protect those who cannot protect themselves.</strong>
      </p>
      <p>Our work extends far beyond the kennel gates.</p>
      <p>
        Our dedicated inspectors investigate reports of animal cruelty, enforce
        animal protection legislation and intervene when animals are suffering.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our veterinary teams provide essential animal healthcare, while our
        animal care staff work tirelessly to ensure that animals arriving at our
        branches receive the attention, comfort and compassion they deserve.
      </p>
      <p>
        Through adoption programmes, educational initiatives and community
        outreach, we also strive to create a future where animals are valued,
        protected and treated with kindness.
      </p>
      <h3>More Than a Century of Making a Difference</h3>
      <p>Since 1910, countless animals have passed through our gates.</p>
      <p>
        Some arrive frightened and confused. Others have experienced neglect,
        abandonment or unimaginable cruelty.
      </p>
      <p>Many simply need a second chance.</p>
      <p>
        Behind every rescue is a life worth saving. Behind every successful
        adoption is a new beginning. And behind every animal that finds
        happiness again are dedicated people who refused to give up.
      </p>
      <p>
        For more than 116 years, our purpose has remained unchanged: to stand up
        for animals, alleviate suffering and inspire a more compassionate
        society.
      </p>
      <h3>Together, We Can Change Lives</h3>
      <p>
        As a non-profit animal welfare organisation, our work depends on the
        generosity, kindness and commitment of the communities we serve.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every donation, adoption, volunteer hour and act of compassion helps us
        continue our mission.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our supporters, volunteers, donors and dedicated staff form the heart of
        the Tshwane SPCA. Together, they make it possible for us to offer
        protection, care and hope to animals who have nowhere else to turn.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong
          >Because animal welfare is not simply about rescuing animals. It is
          about restoring dignity, rebuilding trust, preventing suffering and
          giving every animal the opportunity to experience kindness.</strong
        >
      </p>
      <h3>Our Promise</h3>
      <div class="about-promise">
        <p>To protect the vulnerable.</p>
        <p>To defend the defenceless.</p>
        <p>To speak for those without a voice.</p>
        <p>To promote compassion, respect and responsible animal ownership.</p>
        <p>
          And to continue standing up for animals, just as we have done since
          1910.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-signoff">
        <strong>TSHWANE SPCA</strong
        ><em
          >Two Branches. One Mission. One Unwavering Commitment to Animal
          Welfare.</em
        ><b>Every Life Matters. Every Act of Kindness Makes a Difference.</b>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
